{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"耶利米書","commonName":"耶利米書","title":"耶利米書","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"681b5a173916e28ae5f3b5c6bb5d16263b7d167f21a486ef3c62ed1ab29150f3","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1352},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：「如果丈夫休掉妻子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"妻子離去另嫁別人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"前夫怎會再娶她呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那樣做豈不完全玷污了土地嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你曾與許多情人苟合，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"現在要歸向我嗎？","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"「你舉目看看那些光禿的高山，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你在哪裡沒有被玷污過呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你坐在路旁等候情郎，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就像曠野的遊牧民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的淫亂惡行玷污了土地。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，秋雨不降，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"春雨不來。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你卻仍然不知羞恥，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一副娼妓的嘴臉。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你不是剛對我說，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"『我父啊！你從我年幼時就做我的摯友。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"難道你會永遠發怒、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"懷恨到底嗎？』","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你雖然這樣說，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"卻仍大肆作惡。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["呼籲背信的以色列悔改"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["在約西亞王執政期間，耶和華對我說：「你看見背信的以色列所行的了嗎？她上到高山上、在綠樹下淫亂。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["我以為她淫亂之後會回到我身邊，她卻執迷不悟。她不貞的妹妹猶大也看見了這事。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["因為背信的以色列淫亂，我給她休書，把她休掉。她不貞的妹妹猶大卻不害怕，竟也去淫亂。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["以色列對淫亂不以為然，竟與石頭木頭苟合，玷污了土地。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["儘管如此，她不貞的妹妹猶大只是假裝歸向我，並不誠心。這是耶和華說的。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["耶和華對我說：「背信的以色列比不貞的猶大罪過還輕。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["你去向北方宣告，",{"text":"「『耶和華說，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"背信的以色列啊，回轉吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必不向你們發怒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我充滿慈愛，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不會永遠懷怒。』","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"『你必須要承認自己的罪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"承認背叛了你的上帝耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在綠樹下祭拜各種外邦的神明，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不聽從我的話。』","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"「『背信的子民啊，回轉吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我是你們的主人","poem":1},{"noteId":0},{"text":"。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要從你們中間選些人帶回錫安，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"每座城邑選一人，每個宗族選二人。』","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["「『我要賜給你們合我心意的牧人，讓他們用知識與智慧牧養你們。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["你們在地上繁衍昌盛的時候，人們不會再提及耶和華的約櫃，不會再把它放在心上，不會再想起它，不會再感到需要它，也不會再造一個。這是耶和華說的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["那時，耶路撒冷必被稱為「耶和華的寶座」，萬國都要聚集在耶路撒冷尊崇耶和華的名，不再執迷不悟地作惡。"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["那時，猶大人必與以色列人一同從北方來到我賜給你們祖先作基業的地方。"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"text":"「『我曾想，我多麼願意把你們當成我的兒女，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"賜給你們萬國中最肥美的土地。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我原以為你們會叫我「父親」，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"再不離我而去。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"然而，以色列家啊！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們竟對我不忠，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就像不貞的妻子離開丈夫。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。』」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"text":"從光禿的山頭傳來聲音，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是以色列子民哭泣呼求的聲音，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們走入歧途，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"忘掉了他們的上帝耶和華。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華說：「背信的子民啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"歸來吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要醫治你們背信的病。」","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們說：「是的，我們要到你面前，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你是我們的上帝耶和華。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在高山丘陵上狂歡、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"拜偶像真是枉然，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"唯有我們的上帝耶和華才能拯救以色列。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["「從我們年幼時，那些可恥的神像就吞噬了我們祖先辛苦得來的牛羊和兒女。"]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":["讓我們躺在自己的羞恥中，讓我們的恥辱遮蓋我們吧！因為我們和我們的祖先都得罪了我們的上帝耶和華，我們自幼至今一直沒有順服我們的上帝耶和華。」"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"+","text":"「主人」或譯作「丈夫」。","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":14}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/4.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":25}